  "title": "預熱活動",
  "storyCode": "OF-EX1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9c163078d82233df2a31a0b5b8876ea16386bc39aa84e5489beae049a8f4ba25",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）\n叮鈴鈴，叮鈴鈴，叮鈴鈴......\n咚砰叭砰咚砰叭砰擦擦擦擦擦\n欸欸欸欸欸~♪（人聲vocal）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還不起床！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎......哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨，昨晚high太晚了啦！讓我再多睡會兒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼啊，冷水澡還是很棒！我有預感，今天會是很棒的一天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先把青草汁喝了，已經讓服務生放在你的酒店冰箱裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個也太難喝了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可是知道的，你在昨天黑曜石節的主持節目裡大喊了兩分鐘對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，是哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然你不是歌手，但也要好好保養嗓子啊？不過昨天的演出很成功，祝賀你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我試過了，不論怎麼努力，我還是有那種感覺，我就是沒法超過D.litHun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你已經做得很好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是嗎？嗯......無所謂啦。我決定了，之前那張合作專輯，要比上次再多做四首remix的demo，這樣合作方也有挑選的空間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再加量？！你這幾天已經混了二十六首了，哪怕你把它當作沒出席活動時的練習，也不可以這樣透支體力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事的，昨天晚上，就在演出裡，我摸到了個新點子，這幾個方向我都想試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經差不多知道自己的極限在哪裡了。既然我知道它在那裡，我就得不斷衝擊它，讓它變得更高，讓我更難摸到它，這才是進步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可演出怎麼辦？你的日程表可是一直排到下一年啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "絕對沒問題！演出的精力是放在另一個槽裡的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經聽不懂你在說什麼了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，這麼長時間以來，我有什麼出差錯的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上次你可是把整個錄音棚裡的燈全爆了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是法術的問題，不是音樂吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，你也提醒到我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果理論是正確的，那我在構思和樂感上......絕對能達到更高的高度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......源石技藝和音樂的關係只是種假說，你可不要被牽著鼻子走哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，我有鼻子的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是該現在由你來問我的事情嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但萊塔尼亞人做到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "音符、調子、曲式、織體，都和源石技藝的編織一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚啊！太沉重了！感覺這也不是那麼適合我的思考！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能知道這一點，我已經很欣慰了，嗚嗚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可能要去放鬆一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "挺好的，別憋太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，可也別再把一整個城區弄停電了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，不會的！我會有分寸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了對了，上次你說的那個什麼克洛寧，我也見過一面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感覺怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "實話說......作為合作夥伴，應該不怎麼樣吧。他大概是只看錢的那種人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我上次看合約的時候也有這樣的感覺......無所謂，贊助商這邊也是塞壬說了算。我還是信得過你看人的眼光的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在外面也小心點，據說汐斯塔不簡單。Grace那個帳號也暫時別再用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安心啦，說了我是有分寸的，這可是堡壘中的堡壘，秘密中的秘密！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "經紀人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的秘密小組織，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "音樂人總要有自己的空間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？有簡訊......還好，不愧是旅遊城市，城際網路還是很快的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，這個頻道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“From Ada.Closure.Church”......咦，居然是可露希爾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“聽說這次音樂節非常成功，祝賀你:P”"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“很久沒見了，Grace. 你還聯繫得到Dijkstra嗎？找機會再叫他一起去做點大事吧！”\n“對了，注意身體:3”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天哪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "果然今天也會是很棒的一天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
